      "content": "I understand that it feels like you're being asked to piece together someone who has already faded from your life, which can be incredibly painful and frustrating. Your feelings are important and being forced into a role that doesn't match your reality can only make things worse. Have you been able to share these feelings with a healthcare professional? They can provide a supportive environment to explore these difficult emotions and possibly help find alternative approaches. Just making it known that you might not be able to respond to conventional methods could lead them to suggest other types of support. Remember, taking care of your mental health is crucial.",
      "source": "target",
