      "content": "What you're experiencing sounds incredibly painful and isolating. The struggle of maintaining a persona you no longer resonate with can indeed be exhausting. In such profound times, it's especially important to seek out support systems and friends who understand you. Sometimes, sharing your feelings with someone who can listen without judgment might bring some solace. Although it may feel like you're alone in this experience, you deserve compassion and understanding as you navigate through this phase. Have you thought about joining a support group where you can connect with others going through similar experiences?",
